Here is a comprehensive system instruction and context document designed to be placed directly in your repository (for example, as `docs/superpowers/specs/ai-agent-instructions.md` or inside your `CLAUDE.md`/`README.md` for tools like Cursor or Claude Code).

It explicitly tells the AI agent how to act, what boundaries to respect, and how to execute your milestone plan step-by-step.

